WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
For the development and growth of the Tanglang people

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,320
I'm not afraid of danger

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,760
Let me go to the front line

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:08,300
It’s good to shed blood for our clan’s escape furnace

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,460
I'll let you go to the intelligence team

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,060
You go down first to replenish the troops.

7
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:15,360
Call Fu Feng in by the way.

8
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,120
Add a new intelligence soldier to you

9
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,120
I just happened to take him to have some experience.

10
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,160
Fu Feng is the small commander of the intelligence team

11
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:22,920
You will follow him from now on

12
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:29,000
I'm waiting for the day you make a meritorious service

13
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,440
we received news

14
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:33,040
A large number of golden-armored beetles gathered at the border

15
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,400
We are going to spy on the strength of the golden-armored beetle

16
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,740
Quantity and aggregation purpose

17
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,220
This trip is very dangerous

18
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,780
Everything is subject to my arrangements

19
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,940
Do you understand?

20
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,220
Completely understand

21
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,950
I will definitely hear the little commander’s arrangements.

22
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,620
starting from today

23
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:51,280
Your name is Fu Fengsan

24
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:53,200
More than a hundred of them all landed

25
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,280
Go quietly

26
00:00:54,280 --> 00:01:01,330
come back soon

27
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:04,260
There are several bottles in four bottles

28
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:07,020
We are all going to be killed by you, okay?

29
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:09,180
If you don't run, there will be no hope of escape.

30
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:10,140
prepare to escape
